  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>a</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>On evaluating by integration by parts, we have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So, option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is correct.</p>"
